# Private working notes. NOT ignored by anything in this repository until now --
# only by a global gitignore on one machine, which is not a property the drafts
# can rely on. A fresh clone, a second machine, or a contributor would all have
# committed them. The directory is deliberately outside the repository's history.
.artifacts/
